### Clear stale feedback labels for team-authored issues (1/2)

**Severity:** `medium`

This team-authored path returns without reconciling an existing `Needs-Author-Feedback` label. If a temporary permission lookup failure first sent the issue through community handling, the label can remain after lookup recovers; the scheduled policy closes open issues that retain it for seven inactive days. Clear it here and in the generated lock workflow, tolerating a concurrent 404 removal.

```suggestion
                if (teamIssueLabels.has('Needs-Author-Feedback')) {
                  try {
                    await github.rest.issues.removeLabel({
                      ...context.repo,
                      issue_number: issueNumber,
                      name: 'Needs-Author-Feedback'
                    });
                  } catch (error) {
                    if (error.status !== 404) throw error;
                  }
                }
                core.info('Team-authored issue: applied labels without responding');
```

### Clear stale feedback labels for team-authored issues (2/2)

**Severity:** `medium`

Apply the same stale-label reconciliation in the generated lock workflow as in its source workflow. Otherwise regenerated or deployed automation can retain `Needs-Author-Feedback` after permission lookup recovers, leaving the seven-day stale-feedback close policy able to close a team-authored issue.

```suggestion
              if (teamIssueLabels.has('Needs-Author-Feedback')) {
                try {
                  await github.rest.issues.removeLabel({
                    ...context.repo,
                    issue_number: issueNumber,
                    name: 'Needs-Author-Feedback'
                  });
                } catch (error) {
                  if (error.status !== 404) throw error;
                }
              }
              core.info('Team-authored issue: applied labels without responding');
```
